# Ads, audio, and services

## Ads

Ad unit IDs live only in `src/ads/adConfig.js`. `getAdUnitId` returns Google `TestIds` when `__DEV__` is true. Honor `ADS_ENABLED`. Request `requestNonPersonalizedAdsOnly: true`.

One global `BannerAd`. Screens read `useBannerAd()` and do not mount their own banner. Interstitials go through the open-count helper. Rewarded ads count real listen time; a seek must not count. Initialize Mobile Ads once at startup.

```javascript
// ❌ BAD
InterstitialAd.createForAdRequest('ca-app-pub-xxx/yyy');

// ✅ GOOD
InterstitialAd.createForAdRequest(getAdUnitId('INTERSTITIAL'), {
  requestNonPersonalizedAdsOnly: true,
});
```

## Audio

One `AudioProvider` owns a hidden `react-native-video` player. Play, pause, next, and previous go through that context. Lock-screen actions use the existing notification event names. Check `hasInternetAccess()` before playback and show the translated offline alert on failure. Reading stays available offline.

## Native features

- Lazy-require Notifee so a missing native link does not crash module import.
- Share through `shareService`; ignore share-sheet cancellation.
- Ask for a review only after completed reading or listening sessions, a cooldown, and a present native review module.
- Schedule the daily reminder from a null component under `LanguageProvider` so the copy matches the active language.
